    "UIName": "Igor (PPC)",
    "Id": "vehiclechassisdef_Igor_PPC",
    "Name": "Igor Heavy Lifter",
    "Details": "Ubiquitous across the Inner Sphere, the Igor is a name given to a generic super heavy lift platform. Originally developed to rapidly relocate heavy armor under battlefield conditions, the design has since spawned a host of imitators and copy cats with almost every developed world in the Inner Sphere and the Periphery possessing at least one Igor or Igor derived clone. Developed as a combat mod of the 60 ton VTOL, the Igor (PPC) replaces the original ICE engine with a Fusion power plant and mounts a pair of PPCs in place of the original cargo bay. An SRM-2 and pylon-affixed bomb racks provide extra firepower at close range.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: This unit can not deploy in Lunar biomes.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 6/9 hexes / 180/270 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Armor\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       145     30\n<b>Left</b>         115     30\n<b>Right</b>       115     30\n<b>Rear</b>         90     30\n\n<b>Total</b>      490    150</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Rugged</color>",
    "Icon": "RedKite"
  },
